# Running work
error-runst-abandoned-not-remote = Only work done by a remote assistant can be marked as given up on.
error-runst-adapter-mismatch = That way of running the work doesn't suit the assistant chosen. Choose a matching one.
error-runst-cache-exceeds-tokens = The saved usage figures don't add up. Try again.
error-runst-ended-at-mismatch = The finish time doesn't match the state of the work. Try again.
error-runst-end-reason-too-long = The reason for ending is too long. Shorten it to 500 characters or fewer.
error-runst-inputs-too-many = Too many items were used for this work. Use no more than 100.
error-runst-limit-out-of-range = One of the limits is too low or too high. Each must be at least 1 and within what your setup allows.
error-runst-no-reply-not-slack = Only work done in Slack can be marked as having had no reply.
error-runst-pause-reason-mismatch = A reason for pausing only belongs with paused work. Try again.
error-start-plain-invalid = The description must be 1 to 200 characters and can't contain internal names. Change it and try again.
error-start-too-many-items = That list has too many items. Keep it to 200 or fewer.
error-sup-adapter-refused = The assistant refused to carry on with this work. Try again.
error-sup-lease-lost = This work was interrupted because the computer running it lost hold of it. It can't be restarted; start it afresh.
error-sup-limit-reached = The work stopped because it reached a time, cost or idle limit.
error-sup-no-adapter = ordin can't run work with that kind of assistant on this computer.
error-sup-resume-refused = A safeguard set for your organisation stopped this work from carrying on, so it was ended.
error-sup-run-ended = That work has already finished, so it can't be changed.
error-sup-run-not-found = That work can't be found, or it has already ended, so its record wasn't saved.
error-sup-run-not-paused = That work isn't waiting for an answer from you.
error-sup-seed-empty = There's nothing to start the conversation with. Add some text and try again.
error-sup-stopping = ordin is closing, so new work can't start. Try again after it restarts.
error-sup-store-unavailable = ordin can't save or read work records right now. Try again in a moment.
error-sup-target-is-crew = A task for a whole crew can't be started here. Send it to the crew instead.
error-sup-verb-not-offered = This assistant can't do that.
error-task-arguments-invalid = A task can take up to 50 inputs, each with a name of 1 to 64 characters and a value of up to 4,000 characters. Check them and try again.
error-task-command-invalid = The task name must be 1 to 100 characters. Check it and try again.
error-task-command-xor-text = A task needs either a command or some text, but not both. Remove one.
error-task-immutable = A task can't be changed once it has been submitted. Create a new one instead.
error-task-text-invalid = The task text must be 1 to 8,000 characters. Check it and try again.
